{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act21side_level_act21side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act21side",
  "stageId": "act21side_02",
  "title": "榮譽之人",
  "storyCode": "IS-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8655736047de916c22546bd3c88a112b9958b865656a6f1b0f0a31ae33e4a4d9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你終於醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是......家裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "德米特，你怎麼在這？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是拉維妮婭小姐把你送回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "根據醫生的診斷，你是因為心力交瘁加上受傷，所以昏倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吃蘋果嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就知道你想吃，已經給你削好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拉維妮婭呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她把你交給護衛就走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也知道，她向來是不願意踏入這間宅邸的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了你來一趟已經是奇跡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡拉奇的死，確實是個不小的麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而你受傷的消息肯定也傳出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在，從其他家族的視角看，貝洛內家一瞬間從穩操勝券變成了內憂外患的狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隨時都可能有人來咬我們一口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "襲擊我的那幫人，有沒有留下活口？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且他們的屍體上也沒有留下任何線索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我猜也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你覺得會是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩盧佐一直沒有出手，他們是在等待時機，這對他們來說，顯然是一個好機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "羅塞蒂......雖然瓦拉赫跟我一起遇襲，他們似乎也是受害者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是哥倫比亞家族從來都不是鐵板一塊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對，他們起內訌的可能性是存在的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，也不是沒有別的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，真是挑了個好時機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給我倒點水吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這傢伙，躺在床上倒是比平時還會發號施令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你就一定要端一杯開水給我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是不是該怪你下達的命令不夠準確呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好吧，你總是用這種方法來表達不滿，這次又是什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對德克薩斯的安排，我沒法同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拉維妮婭是個公正的人，她不會誣陷任何一個清白的人，她有她的考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我是說，她原本應該成為你的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "首領既然把她交給你，就有她不會危害家族的把握。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你應該把她打造成一把利器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而現在，她卻被拉維妮婭關了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別告訴我，你看不出她也是為了我們家族考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我承認，在如今這麼危險的情況下，還握著德克薩斯這顆燙手山芋，會讓你的處境更加岌岌可危。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她的姓氏再度在敘拉古的土地上出現......實在是太惹眼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實，以拉維妮婭的立場，德克薩斯握在她的手上會更加安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我們家族內部的人，他們會怎麼想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們會覺得，你，貝洛內家的大少爺萊昂圖索，已經太沉迷於在桌布上扮家家酒的遊戲，你變得軟弱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你甚至用不好一把刀，還丟失了它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "貝洛內家已經落入下風，不論想找麻煩的是誰，我們都應該強硬地回擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萊昂，沃爾西尼的新城區不光是你在的建設部的什麼無聊“事業”，它該屬於貝洛內家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以這才是你的真心話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也有我的考慮，德米特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "願聞其詳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧，你是我最好的兄弟，也是我的顧問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在遇襲的時候我就感覺到有些不對了，在聽到卡拉奇死後，我就更加明確了這個想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你剛才問我覺得是誰下的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "實際上我不覺得是薩盧佐或者羅塞蒂的人幹的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下手的人太瞭解我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他知道怎麼樣才能快速而且精確地打擊到貝洛內，同時也能打擊到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的意思是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下來幾天，我會閉門不出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我需要好好養傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別人認為我們亂了陣腳，那就讓他們繼續這麼認為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到真正的對手自己露出尾巴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你是故意放任拉維妮婭帶走德克薩斯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於她想怎麼用這張牌，交給她自己決定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這段時間，肯定會有不少針對我們家族的行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你多注意調查背後都是誰在搗鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，這個答案，能讓你滿意嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你有明確的想法，那我自然會去執行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_690_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "畢竟，你才是這裡的老大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這還差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......別讓我失望啊，德米特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，瓦拉赫，是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萊昂，我聽說你受傷不輕，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "關於白天發生的事，我們需要聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想......你也有要問我的事，有關那個名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......“德克薩斯”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沃爾西尼監獄"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你當時被拖住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個拖住你的人是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一個舊識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "舊識？在這個時候出現的舊識？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很適應這種場合，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在龍門，我偶爾也會接受這樣的盤問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龍門......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總之，我沒有必要這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......每一個犯人都是這麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "實際上，我相信你並不是兇手，切利尼娜小姐。我實在難以想像做這件事對你有任何好處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，萊昂聯繫過我，他說，出於某些原因，你是可以信任的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......原來如此，你出現在了那麼多名流都在場的地方，那本就是貝洛內家給你準備的舞台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，在如今這樣的情況下，將你放在我這邊，才是最好的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在保護萊昂圖索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是在保護你，德克薩斯小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且......這樣或許能分散些其他家族的注意力，他們會猜測貝洛內家族在被如此打擊之後，到底會作何打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這種忌憚......或許能讓我更好地放開手腳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真的是法官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼這麼問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看起來非常瞭解家族是如何運作的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我確實是一名法官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在敘拉古，想要做好我的職業，我就必須要比家族成員們更瞭解，他們是如何生存的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使我根本不想瞭解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，你理解錯了，我的意思是，身為執法者，對執法對象有所瞭解是理所當然的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反而是過去的敘拉古，我從沒聽說過存在這樣的法官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要搞錯了，切利尼娜·德克薩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我並不是因為所謂家族之間的制衡而將你帶了過來。外人或許會這麼判斷我的立場，我不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你剛來到這座城市，你還不明白，卡拉奇部長究竟有多麼重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他是一個非常值得尊重的人。他原本可以將正在建造中的新城市變得更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不僅僅是工業上的建設，他想讓市民們有可能過上另一種生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而他現在死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想要找出兇手，將他繩之以法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們自以為可以除掉一個又一個不聽從他們命令的傀儡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我會讓他們知道，他們除掉的不是一個個傀儡，而是一個個活生生的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，卡拉奇的死，和你無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且你也沒有發現兇手是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我交給你的任務，查探貝洛內把德克薩斯找來究竟想要幹什麼你也沒有頭緒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您果然算無遺策，我親愛的父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而你在什麼都沒有做到的情況下，還沒有在我召集會議的時候趕回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個季節，路上有點塞車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拉普蘭德，我在七年前把你逐出家門，你不再擁有薩盧佐這個姓氏，你知道這意味著什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我當然知道，這意味著您在想要除掉我這個不聽話的工具時，不會再手軟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你總是很有自知之明，但你似乎並沒有做出與你的自知之明相符合的行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是給那個可憐的小法官一點警告而已，真的需要我去做嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......為什麼我會想要去警告那個法官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然那位大少爺閉門不出，那麼，那個放出狠話的小法官自然會被認為是貝洛內的代表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而以您的性格，必然不會就這麼相信貝洛內真的就那麼示弱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼，用那個法官的安危試探一下貝洛內的深淺不是理所當然的事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你知道該怎麼做，我要看到成果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我當然不會違背您的命令，前提是，您想要的和我一致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我最最親愛的父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "薩爾瓦多雷！我們該怎麼辦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我該感謝你把我從血親的控制中解脫出來嗎？我該感謝你為了那些感染者勞工們能吃飽肚子而不惜沾上鮮血嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "你殺死的人是我的父親！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "不，你不需要向我陳述他的罪惡，我比你更清楚。你我身上的這些傷痕，正來源於他的施暴。那些勞工的死，正來源於他的盤剝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "可是，可是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "薩爾瓦多雷，我真心實意地感謝你，你救了我，或許還救了很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "可是，你身上的血腥味正越來越濃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我們，我們離開這裡吧，薩爾瓦多雷，帶我去一個......帶我去一個能獲得平靜的地方，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "或許已經太晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "薩爾瓦多雷，或許當你來到哥倫比亞的第一天，或許當你第一次打磨自己的那把小刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "這一切都已經註定發生，不可挽回了，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我在想，如果我是這位薇薇安，我會原諒薩爾瓦多雷嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "即使能夠原諒，這種芥蒂也會伴隨著兩個人一輩子吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說得完全正確，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兩個人最後結合在了一起，當然是一種藝術加工處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "事實上，真正的薩爾瓦多雷，並沒有和那位薇薇安女士結合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且，薇薇安的父親雖然確實為富不仁，他卻對自己的家人照顧有加，尤其是將薇薇安視作自己的掌上明珠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "並沒有那麼多純粹的惡人，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，即使那是自己深愛的人，即使自己的父親確實作惡多端，這也並不是輕易就能原諒的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薇薇安女士，最後選擇離開薩爾瓦多雷，前往另外一座城市，並在那裡邂逅了一個真正愛她的人，開始了新的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，終她一生，她都沒有忘記薩爾瓦多雷這個男人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，某種意義上，這個故事，也算是幫她圓夢吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "你很瞭解......薇薇安女士嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我叫卡特琳娜，美麗的演員小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是新來的演員嗎？我常常會來這裡，似乎以前並沒有見過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "是的，我叫空，來自龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龍門？真有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我聽說去龍門發展的演員有不少，像你這樣從龍門來的，倒是很少見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "有的時候，逆潮流也有逆潮流的好處嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這我倒是同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "卡特琳娜小姐，關於這位薇薇安女士，您知道現實中她後來怎麼樣了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薇薇安......薇薇安她啊，她一直沒有忘記薩爾瓦多雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許是這個原因吧，她的兒子，也走上了和薩爾瓦多雷相似的道路——成了家族的一員，並一步一步成了某個家族的領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而這個家族，在後來與薩爾瓦多雷產生了衝突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所幸，有薇薇安出面，他們兩人並沒有變成你死我活的關係，反而最終結成了盟友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "難道說，就是劇本中的羅塞蒂家族？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "完全正確，你已經把劇本都讀過了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "嗯......出於一些個人的原因，我也想盡可能地瞭解德克薩斯這個家族的過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你覺得這個故事，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "我......有一些無法認可的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦？比如？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "比如薩爾瓦多雷的孫女......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "空，造型師讓你來看看衣服的設計！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊，好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "抱歉，我先失陪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去吧，我們還會有再見的機會的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "空——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別著急，我們以後還可以慢慢聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "啊，好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......薩爾瓦多雷的孫女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你又在劇院裡浪費時間了，首領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#14$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我說過很多次了，瓦拉赫，這不是浪費時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了寫一個破劇本，把大部分雜事丟給我，這也是一個家族領袖該做的事？你還給自己起了個叫卡特琳娜的假名？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡特琳娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有意見？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不敢。您畢竟是喬萬娜·羅塞蒂，我最敬愛的首領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白你的不滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這座城市裡，有什麼值得我操心的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前沒有，現在有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡拉奇死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，卡拉奇原本就是其他家族們為了互相制衡而推上去的普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他死了，說明貝洛內能力不足，僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一個長得很像切利尼娜的人突然出現在了萊昂圖索身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說，誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "德克薩斯，切利尼娜·德克薩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瓦拉赫，我記得你應該不是個喜歡開玩笑的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而你應該也知道，我最討厭開德克薩斯玩笑的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我並沒有在開玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "貝洛內不知道用什麼辦法找來了這個人。那顯眼的髮色......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和你那張合照上的人一模一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她沒死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她跟在萊昂圖索身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當年的清算，如果不是某個家族把她保下來，她絕無可能活下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......如果保下她的是貝洛內，倒也說得通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來，得找貝洛內談一談了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喬萬娜，這顯然是他們的陷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瓦拉赫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......對不起，首領。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "與其說是陷阱，不如說是陽謀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大度點，瓦拉赫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果當年真的是貝洛內保下了切利尼娜，我就算登門拜訪向他們道謝又有何妨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "準備一下吧，“談生意”結束了，我要來造訪沃爾西尼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我知道了，我會去安排的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬萬娜",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_687_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，看來，新劇本要稍微擱置一段時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "首領，你明明知道卡拉奇的死對我們來說是個機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你卻依然關心著德克薩斯這個姓氏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_695_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣下去，羅塞蒂是沒有未來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
